  Candidates: @candidates/INDEX.sdd
  Lessons: @lessons/INDEX.sdd
  Insights: @../insights/INDEX.sdd
  References: @../references/INDEX.sdd
  Canonicalization: @../concepts/CANONICALIZATION.sdd
  Relationships: @../concepts/RELATIONSHIP-VOCABULARY.sdd

